=== lvmdump ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/usr/sbin/lvmdump [options]


FLAGS (9) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-h print
-a advanced     then this script may hang as well if -a is used
-c if
-d <directory>  dump into a directory instead of tarball
-l gather
-p gather
-m gather
-s gather
-u gather
